NEARS-1203 — WHICH gate fires, + PII-safety of the new log line
================================================================
The tests alone cannot tell you which rejection path fired. Two paths exist:
  NEW gate (this ticket) : Log::warning('item bulk update rejected: items outside the admin zone')
                           + toast messages.bulk_import_items_not_in_your_zone
  OLD check (pre-existing): doesntExist() -> toast "Item doesnt exist at the database", NO log line

BE-log grep (scoped to the gate string — never a dump of laravel.log):

